Package: readNBS
Title: Access Data from China's National Bureau of Statistics
Version: 0.8.3
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Chartwell", family = "Macro", email = "chartwellmacro@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")
    )
Description: Provides a defensive client for selected time series and release
    tables from the National Bureau of Statistics of China (NBS). It exposes
    stable semantic identifiers and dimensional dataset descriptors backed by
    versioned bilingual manifests, while isolating the portal's undocumented
    UUID-based JSON transport, schema checks, bounded per-client caching, and
    provenance. Bundled normalized first-release archives support deterministic
    access to historical press tables, and explicit helpers preserve reporting
    calendars and optionally regularise cumulative flows without silently
    changing the published observations.
